Package: jellyfin-ffmpeg-nvmpi
Version: 7.1-nvmpi
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Depends: libasound2, libbsd0, libegl1, libexpat1, libglib2.0-0, libgomp1, libicu66, libjpeg-turbo8, liblzma5, libpcre3, libpng16-16, libssl1.1, libv4l-0, libx11-6, libxcb1, libxcb-shm0, libxext6, libxml2
Maintainer: phongphuhanam
Description: FFmpeg (jellyfin-ffmpeg equivalent) with jetson-ffmpeg nvmpi
 hardware-accelerated H.264/HEVC encode+decode for Jetson/Tegra devices.
 Requires running with nvidia-container-runtime and
 NVIDIA_VISIBLE_DEVICES/NVIDIA_DRIVER_CAPABILITIES set for the nvmpi
 codecs to actually work (that runtime supplies the EGL vendor config
 and device nodes this package alone cannot).
